'''Immortal Zenith''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Behemoth's Peak]]. [[Ultima Beast Naala]] resides here and can be unlocked as [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Elder Beast Naala]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a [[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radar]] is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

