==Trivia==
*If [[Ultima Beast Naala]] represents [[wikipedia:Eikþyrnir|Eikþyrnir]] from Norse mythology, Immortal Zenith may correlate or contrast with how Eikþyrnir stands upon one of the afterlife locations, [[wikipedia:Valhalla|Valhalla]], as the stage's Japanese name (天寿を授ける頂 ''Tenju o Sazukeru Itadaki'') can be literally translated as "The Summit That Bestows Natural Lifespans"; 天寿 ''tenju'' consists of the kanji for "heaven" and "longevity" and means one's natural lifespan.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Elder Beast Naala]] had a 3% drop chance from this stage.

